'Studio Overview':'Studio Overview','Clients':'Clients','Plan & Habits':'Plan aur habits','Daily Records':'Daily Records','Journals':'Journals','Resource Library':'Resource Library','Progress Reports':'Progress Reports','Agreements':'Agreements','Coach Notes':'Coach Notes',
