'Short habit name':'Habit ka chhota naam','Why it matters':'Yeh kyun zaroori hai','Completion standard':'Complete kab maana jayega','Client-chosen work block':'Client ka chuna hua work block','Agreed alternative':'Agreed alternative',
'Your coaching studio':'Tumhara coaching studio','Welcome back, Rituparna':'Welcome back, Rituparna',
'PERSONAL SPACE':'PERSONAL SPACE','No entry yet.':'Abhi entry nahi hai.',
'PERSONAL PROGRESS / DEMO REPORT':'PERSONAL PROGRESS / DEMO REPORT','Actions behind the numbers':'Numbers ke peeche ke actions','What needs a conversation?':'Kis baat par conversation chahiye?',
